od) % mod;\n\n            lst = nz;\n        }\n\n        System.out.println(total % mod);\n    }\n\n    // helper: accumulate with modulo addition\n    private static List<Integer> accumulate(List<Integer> list, int mod) {\n        List<Integer> result = new ArrayList<>();\n        long sum = 0;\n        for (int val : list) {\n            sum = (sum + val) % mod;\n            result.add((int) sum);\n        }\n        return result;\n    }\n}\n</translated_code>\n<confidence>\n0.95\n</confidence>", "token_logprobs": [-5.364403477869928e-06, 0.0, 0.0, -7.366862701019272e-05, -0.00027259447961114347, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -0.1269296258687973, -0.47412723302841187, -1.0728830375228426e-06, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, 0.0, -0.6931475400924683, -5.960462772236497e-07, -2.0265558760002023e-06, 0.0, -1.4305104514278355e-06, 0.0, -8.344646857949556e-07, -5.960462772236497e-07, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -3.909988299710676e-05, -0.0410064198076725, -2.169585604860913e-05, 0.0, -3.576278118089249e-07, 0.0, -0.018496647477149963, -0.014166739769279957, -1.1920928244535389e-07, -2.264974000354414e-06, 0.0, -0.0011743560899049044, -0.5759548544883728, -2.2053474822314456e-05, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.025778373703360558, -0.005238260142505169, -0.0004472924047149718, -0.011968821287155151, 0.0, -4.172316494077677e-06, -0.00015841660206206143, -4.768370445162873e-07, -4.768370445162873e-07, -1.1920928244535389e-07, 0.0, -5.1973900554003194e-05, -1.9073468138230965e-06, -1.9073468138230965e-06, -9.536738616588991e-07, -0.02995162457227707, -0.25210118293762207, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, 0.0, -5.960462772236497e-07, -2.861018856492592e-06, 0.0, -4.0531076592742465e-06, -7.152555099310121e-07, -0.00034731553751043975, -0.000559292733669281, -0.36651885509490967, -1.1920922133867862e-06, -1.6689286894688848e-06, 0.0, -2.3841855067985307e-07, -0.01105151604861021, -5.960462772236497e-07, -0.000717025191988796, -3.576278118089249e-07, -0.0004612335760612041, -9.536738616588991e-07, -1.